ADDRESS: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013
==================================================
The  [LINK: (2013 Boston Marathon) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Boston_Marathon]  is disrupted by the  [LINK: (bombing) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boston_Marathon_bombing] , becoming one of the deadliest domestic terrorist attacks in the  [LINK: (US) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States] ;

[LINK: (Pope Francis) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Francis]  is elected in the  [LINK: (conclave) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_conclave] ; the conclave happened because Pope  [LINK: (Benedict XVI) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benedict_XVI]   [LINK: (resigned) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resignation_of_Pope_Benedict_XVI]  due to health reasons;

[LINK: (Edward Snowden) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edward_Snowden] , former  [LINK: (NSA) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NSA]  contractor and whistleblower,  [LINK: (leaks) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2010s_global_surveillance_disclosures]  classified documents revealing the existence of global surveillance programs;

a  [LINK: (shooting) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westgate_shopping_mall_shooting]  on the  [LINK: (Westgate mall) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westgate,_Nairobi]  in  [LINK: (Kenya) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kenya]  that took place over several days kills 71, including all perpetrators;

the mysterious  [LINK: (Chelyabinsk meteor) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chelyabinsk_meteor]  superbolide that entered Earth's atmosphere over  [LINK: (Russia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russia] ; no deaths have been reported, but almost 1,500 are injured;

a  [LINK: (building collapse in Bangladesh) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Savar_building_collapse]  kills 1,134 and is one of the biggest structural failures in  [LINK: (Bangladesh) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangladesh] ;

[LINK: (North India floods) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_North_India_floods]  kill 6,054; the floods also expanded to  [LINK: (Nepal) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nepal]  and  [LINK: (Tibet) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tibet] ;

a  [LINK: (nightclub fire) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiss_nightclub_fire]  leads to a stampede that killed 242;

[LINK: (Microsoft) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft]  launches the  [LINK: (Xbox One) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xbox_One] ;

[LINK: (Frozen) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frozen_(2013_film)]  is released, becoming a global phenomenon with its signature song " [LINK: (Let It Go) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Let_It_Go] ".

