[LINK: (September 21) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/September_21]  –  [LINK: (Al-Shabaab) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Al-Shabaab_(militant_group)]  militants  [LINK: (attack) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westgate_shopping_mall_attack]  the  [LINK: (Westgate shopping mall) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westgate,_Nairobi]  in  [LINK: (Nairobi, Kenya) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi,_Kenya] , killing at least 62 civilians and wounding over 170. [LINK: ([66]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-66]

[LINK: (October 10) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_10]  – Delegates from some 140 countries and territories sign the  [LINK: (Minamata Treaty) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minamata_Convention_on_Mercury] , a  [LINK: (UNEP) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations_Environment_Programme]  treaty designed to protect human health and the environment from emissions and releases of  [LINK: (mercury) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury_(element)]  and mercury compounds. [LINK: ([67]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-67]

[LINK: (October 15) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_15]  – A  [LINK: (magnitude) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moment_magnitude_scale]  7.2  [LINK: (earthquake) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earthquake]   [LINK: (struck) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Bohol_earthquake]   [LINK: (Bohol) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohol] , Philippines, leaving 222 dead, 8 missing, and 976 people injured. [LINK: ([68]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-68]

[LINK: (October 12) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_12]  – Twelve people are killed when an  [LINK: (apartment building collapses) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collapse_of_the_Space_Building]  in  [LINK: (Medellín, Colombia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medell%C3%ADn] . [LINK: ([69]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-69]

[LINK: (October 16) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_16]  –  [LINK: (Lao Airlines Flight 301) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lao_Airlines_Flight_301]  crashes on approach to  [LINK: (Pakse Airport) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakse_Airport] , Laos, killing all 49 people on board.

[LINK: (October 17) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_17]  –  [LINK: (Microsoft) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft]  releases  [LINK: (Windows 8.1) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windows_8.1] .

[LINK: (October 18) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/October_18]  –  [LINK: (Saudi Arabia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saudi_Arabia]  rejects a seat on the  [LINK: (United Nations Security Council) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations_Security_Council] , making it the first country to reject a seat on the Security Council.  [LINK: (Jordan) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jordan]  takes the seat on  [LINK: (December 6) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/December_6] . [LINK: ([70]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-aawsat-70]

[LINK: (November 5) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_5]  – The uncrewed  [LINK: (Mars Orbiter Mission) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mars_Orbiter_Mission]  is launched by India from its launch pad in  [LINK: (Sriharikota) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sriharikota] . [LINK: ([71]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-71]

[LINK: (November 8) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_8]  –  [LINK: (Typhoon Haiyan) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Typhoon_Haiyan]  (Yolanda), one of the strongest  [LINK: (tropical cyclones) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_cyclone]  on record, hits the  [LINK: (Philippines) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philippines]  and  [LINK: (Vietnam) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vietnam] , causing devastation with at least 6,241 people dead. [LINK: ([72]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-72]

[LINK: (November 12) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_12]  –  [LINK: (Three Studies of Lucian Freud) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Studies_of_Lucian_Freud] , a series of portraits of  [LINK: (Lucian Freud) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucian_Freud]  by the  [LINK: (British) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom]  painter  [LINK: (Francis Bacon) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Francis_Bacon_(artist)] , sells for  [LINK: (US$) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_dollar] 142.4 million in a  [LINK: (New York City) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_City]  auction, setting a world record for an auctioned work of art. [LINK: ([73]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-73]  [LINK: ([74]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-NYT_sale-74]

[LINK: (November 17) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_17] 
Fifty people are killed when  [LINK: (Tatarstan Airlines Flight 363) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatarstan_Airlines_Flight_363]  crashes at Kazan Airport, Russia.
A  [LINK: (tornado outbreak) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tornado_outbreak_of_November_17,_2013]  occurs in  [LINK: (Illinois) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois] , United States.  [LINK: (An EF4 tornado in Washington) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Washington,_Illinois,_tornado]  causes $935 million ($1.262 billion adjusted) of property damage, killing 3 people. [LINK: ([75]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-75]

Fifty people are killed when  [LINK: (Tatarstan Airlines Flight 363) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatarstan_Airlines_Flight_363]  crashes at Kazan Airport, Russia.

A  [LINK: (tornado outbreak) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tornado_outbreak_of_November_17,_2013]  occurs in  [LINK: (Illinois) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois] , United States.  [LINK: (An EF4 tornado in Washington) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013_Washington,_Illinois,_tornado]  causes $935 million ($1.262 billion adjusted) of property damage, killing 3 people. [LINK: ([75]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-75]

[LINK: (November 21) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/November_21] 
 [LINK: (Euromaidan) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euromaidan]  pro-EU demonstrations begin in Ukraine after President  [LINK: (Viktor Yanukovych) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viktor_Yanukovych]  rejects an economic association agreement between the  [LINK: (European Union) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_Union]  and Ukraine in favor of closer ties to Russia. [LINK: ([76]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-76] 
 [LINK: (Moldovan) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moldova] - [LINK: (flagged) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ship_registration]   [LINK: (cargo ship) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cargo_ship]   [LINK: (MV Rhosus) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MV_Rhosus]  makes port in  [LINK: (Beirut, Lebanon) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beirut,_Lebanon] , carrying 2,750 tonnes of  [LINK: (ammonium nitrate) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ammonium_nitrate] . After inspection by port state control, the Rhosus is deemed  [LINK: (unseaworthy) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seakeeping] , and is forbidden to set sail. By order of an Urgent Matters judge in Beirut, the cargo is brought ashore in  [LINK: (2014) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2014]  and placed in Warehouse 12 at the port, where it will remain for six years. The ammonium nitrate will erupt in a  [LINK: (massive explosion) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020_Beirut_explosion]  on  [LINK: (August 4) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/August_4] ,  [LINK: (2020) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020] . [LINK: ([77]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-rhosus.shiparrested-77]  [LINK: ([78]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013#cite_note-rhosus.bbc-78]

